5. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY, COPYRIGHT & OWNERSHIP RETENTION
================================================================================
5.1. Moral & Author Rights:
Praveen Chavan retains all moral rights, underlying copyright, authorship, title, and ownership 
of the original WorkSphere and TalentHub software architectures, schemas, workflows, and core algorithms.

5.2. No Implied Transfer:
Nothing in this Licence, the public website, or general correspondence shall be construed as an 
assignment or transfer of intellectual property ownership. Any transfer or exclusive rights must be 
explicitly agreed upon in a formal bilateral contract executed by Praveen Chavan.

5.3. Protection of Trade Secrets:
The source code, database architectures, and engineering models constitute valuable confidential 
information and trade secrets of Praveen Chavan. Licensees receiving source code must maintain strict 
confidentiality and ensure that repository access is restricted to authorized personnel under appropriate NDA.

