7. COMPLIANCE, CONFIDENTIALITY & RESTRICTIONS
================================================================================
Licensees, subscribers, and evaluators agree:
  (a) Not to publicly publish, upload to open repositories (e.g. public GitHub/GitLab), leak, 
      or freely redistribute the source code or database migrations;
  (b) Not to reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble hosted SaaS endpoints;
  (c) Not to remove, obscure, or alter any copyright notices, watermark statements, or legal credits 
      contained within the software source code;
  (d) To comply with all applicable data privacy and labor regulations regarding employee records 
      processed on the platform.

